{"reviewId": "254854030_87DILzIPg", "review": {"type": 1, "bookId": "3300128305", "chapterUid": 10, "content": "当一个国家走到工业化转折期，也就是从高速扩张、靠投资和出口拉动增长的阶段，开始转向成熟阶段时，过去那种靠多建工厂、多修基建、多出口就能轻松高增长的模式慢慢走不动了，增长会变得不稳定，容易出现波动，而这时候经济能不能继续健康、持续地往前走，已经不再是靠多投入资源、多上项目就能解决，关键要看制度层面能不能跟上，比如分配制度、金融制度、产业政策、市场规则、产权保护、政府与市场的关系这些深层次的制度安排是否合理有效，如果制度改革能跟上，增长就能顺利转型并持续下去，如果制度跟不上，原来的矛盾就会不断积累，经济增长就会失去动力甚至陷入停滞。", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "abstract": "在这样的阶段中，一个国家增长的不确定性开始增加，而且经济增长的可持续性越来越受到制度因素的左右。", "range": "1072-1120", "chapterName": "05 走向成熟 中国经济即将V形反转", "chapterIdx": 10, "reviewId": "254854030_87DILzIPg", "userVid": 254854030, "topics": [], "createTime": 1773628369, "userEditTime": 1790267714, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "05 走向成熟 中国经济即将V形反转", "author": {"userVid": 254854030, "name": "薄荷白桃乌龙茶", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/DYAIOgq83eotCrwSFSicibG99Nkf5vrg0ff5gIBNXvxUEHLjQOgqCkgge06Nib9Vp2791QZZJPKUpm1JVpXRn1RoA/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M13-20240826-10", "desc": "每周阅读挑战", "title": "完美阅读周", "levelIndex": 10}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 27, "likes": [{"userVid": 347026738, "name": "Stays", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/lWfF1X3ty2bg47DYg6VFTbcm25CgibmTAlNxJuWuPzjYqEmbXJVMpxetVBkjhFk8YxqID6Y15SLZycMzSWicmoPtNMqQB9mZuCs6ydNJArMnc/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-